WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:03.970
<i>If that thing goes from one 
end of Edo to the other,</i>

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>nothing will be left!</i>

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.480
<i>Impressive.</i>

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>I have an even more worthy opponent this year.</i>

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.350
Hey, Rikichi...

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.810
Working hard? Or hardly working?

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.080
An earthquake?

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:44.450
Is Mt. Fuji about to erupt?

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:51.710
Wh-What is that?

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:54.780
The forest... The forest is...

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.570
It's moving?

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.740
<b>Summer War 
in Edo!!</b>

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.160
Reporting!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.110
A messenger has just arrived from Kanhasshu.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:34.670
They claim the forest is moving 
from Hakone and Soushuu.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.670
<b>Samurai House Patrol 
Oogami Kagetada</b>

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.870
Insect Magistrate...

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.170
This year's summer is upon us.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.430
<b>Shrine and Temple Patrol 
Shirasagaki Yumehisa</b>

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.420
It is a fortress-class insect.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.540
So summer's here?

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.400
That means tonight is...

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.070
Yup, the best part of summer...

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.670
The Ryougoku River Opening!

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:02.700
A river opening?

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:05.050
Is that the fireworks festival?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.200
I still haven't seen them.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:11.410
The Ryougoku River Opening... I can't wait!

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.210
<b>Famous Edo Sights: 
Ryougoku River Opening</b>

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.160
We'd better get started.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.430
Rejoice, Jinbei.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.390
I shall redress your ignorance

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.310
by telling you the origin of the 
Sumidagawa River Opening.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.240
It began as a festival of the water god

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.560
Sake! Bring me sake!

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.090
created by Shogun Tokugawa Yoshimune

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.970
Understood!

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:34.070
to appease the souls of dead

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.880
Go get it yourself.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:36.480
and drive off evil spirits...

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.490
Catching goldfish, candy, pictures, balloons!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.520
 Could it be?

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:38.750
And, and...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:39.800
Eh?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.650
They're ignoring me?

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:47.150
Um, Ieshige-sama, while I did permit daily visits,

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.830
I didn't mean that you should 
loiter here every single day...

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.010
What a pleasant sound...

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.760
Huh?

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.280
The wind stopped?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.460
It's summer!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.790
The grass grows high,

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:33.540
the trees grow green,

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.540
and life flourishes everywhere.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:44.800
And the ultimate bug appears in Edo!

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.890
I suppose summer really is here...

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:02.530
What is that huge insect?!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.530
The famous rhinoceros beetle.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:14.710
<b>Masuraou Kabuto - Warrior King Beetle</b>

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:13.450
We call it the Warrior King Beetle.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.420
If that thing goes from one 
end of Edo to the other,

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.560
nothing will be left!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.730
I would imagine so.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.520
Why are you so calm?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:42.570
Isn't it your job 
to exterminate those things?

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:46.200
Yes, I am well aware of that.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.880
The dust storm is headed this way!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.640
I c-can do it...

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:17.050
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.270
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms.</i>

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.360
<i>Repentance</i>

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.990
<i>Slash!</i>

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.870
The Insect Magistrate Officers are here!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:44.060
Now, let's finish this.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.630
Koikawa-dono!

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:48.630
Hibachi-dono!

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.000
Tenma-dono...

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.440
Where did everyone go?

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.540
You're in the way. 
Go somewhere safe.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:11.560
Koikawa, check that no one's 
still in the town over there.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.660
Why should I listen to you?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.610
Tenma, remove anything that 
blocks the evacuation route.

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:19.830
O-Okay.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.540
Huh? Where's Tsukishima?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.050
I forgot.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.230
What's going on?

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:32.800
Aren't your officers attacking it at all?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:38.730
You rarely ever stepped outside, 
so you may not know this...

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:43.310
But every summer, 
fortress-class insects like that appear.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:47.470
And when that happens, 
we follow a certain rule.

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:48.960
A rule?

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.030
Yes.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.760
Everyone but Mugai-kun is to 
focus on civilian evacuation,

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:58.660
treating the wounded, and ensuring 
the escape routes are cleared.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.620
And Mugai-kun takes care 
of the insect of himself.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:06.200
That is the Insect Magistrate's

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.630
<b>Summer War</b>

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.630
Summer War.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.130
Impressive.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.290
I have an even more worthy opponent this year.

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:27.310
Um, miss?

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.150
What are you doing over here?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.160
Fireworks.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.330
Eh?

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:41.980
I'm certain you cannot see 
the fireworks from here.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.650
I'm actually on my way to 
see the fireworks now...

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.990
Would you like to come with me?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.580
That will not happen.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:52.210
Huh?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.910
I cannot leave this place.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.460
<i>She can't leave?</i>

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.340
<i>She appears to be of noble birth...</i>

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:05.430
<i>Is she the daughter of 
someone who works here?</i>

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.370
I understand!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:12.110
You're waiting for your parents, 
so you can't leave, right?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.580
Hmm?

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:39.350
What are all these tremors I keep hearing?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.350
You don't know?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:44.030
I am very sorry!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:47.100
I only just arrived, and there are 
many things I do not know.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:54.610
They are just testing the fireworks.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.430
Nothing to worry about.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:58.610
I see.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:03.120
Then the fireworks will start soon, right?

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:07.110
I can't keep everyone waiting any longer.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:26.610
Young lady...

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.400
Let's find a place within these walls
 you can see the fireworks from!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.440
The dust clouds are blocking my view.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.150
Do not worry.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:44.100
Mugai-kun will defeat
 the Warrior King Beetle.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.670
Kotori-san!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.420
The evacuation is essentially complete.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.520
Glad to hear it.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:54.670
You! Violent girl!

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:59.170
Don't you want to see Mugai-kun fighting up close?

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.320
Of course I do.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.430
I'm about to go.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.430
Then take me, too!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.100
Wait, Ieshige...

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.560
What are you doing?!

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.390
Nagatomimaru-sama, no, -kun...

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:12.720
We're way over the weight limit...

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:15.440
Don't touch me, you two perverts!

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.680
It's part of my duty.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.380
I am not a pervert!

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:47.060
You seem quite proud of this horn.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.400
If it is that wonderful,

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:04.070
then I shall make use of it.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.990
Mugai-kun's about to attack...

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.080
Mugai-san really is wonderful.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.170
What about those people over there?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.060
Are they all insane?

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:21.170
Why would they hold a party
 at a time like this?

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:23.850
It can't be helped...

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:28.140
The Insect Magistrate's Summer War

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.780
Hey, bring us some drinks!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.240
is one of Edo's famous summer events, 
just like the River Opening.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.940
Do you have any food?

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.500
Yes, coming right up!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.690
Knock it into the ground!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:44.200
You're in the way! Now I can't see Mugai!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:01.210
Miss, please wait a second...

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:05.220
I'll find everything we need to enjoy the fireworks!

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.470
What are you looking for?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.220
A carpet.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:15.760
I can't let someone like you sit on a straw mat!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:18.520
We need a carpet.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.810
I can't control it!

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.410
Is it going to jump?

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:45.540
Half a rhinoceros beetle's 
body is powerful muscle.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:51.010
Its rapid contractions cause the wings 
to flap, allowing it to fly freely.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:53.170
But that is something else!

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:59.680
It's flapping its wings to create a 
powerful dust storm around itself!

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:02.150
There's nowhere to run!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.450
<i>Jingaitou:</i>

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.490
<i>Rhino Form!</i>

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.750
<i>Wind Barrier!</i>

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.460
What?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.820
Mugai is using his slashes to make a wall?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.720
<i>Rhino Form.</i>

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.340
<i>Flying Water!</i>

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.310
<i>Tougher than expected...</i>

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:43.020
<i>Double Arrow!</i>

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:00.570
<i>Jingaitou:</i>

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.630
<i>Cascade!</i>

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.080
I couldn't find even one...

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.050
They must have taken all of them.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.620
I found a carpet.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.310
Thank you so much!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.690
It's hard to find a good spot...

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:42.950
It's fine.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.280
Fireworks are merely a distraction.

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:50.140
How about there?

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.930
The watchtower?

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.070
"Uzumasa

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:12.070
took his blade, and he slew

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.400
the greatest of the Eternal Land's gods."

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.530
Impossible.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:21.030
The katana is absorbing the horn?

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.210
<i>Jingaitou: Transformation.</i>

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>Attack Form: Rhino!</i>

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.180
The Jingaitou Transformation landed!

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.610
Mugai wins!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.530
What a show!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:56.870
Splendid! Finest in Japan!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:16.550
It's begun.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.570
Let's hurry!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.600
Take my hand.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.520
Stop.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:27.360
No one is allowed to touch me.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.770
Now, let's go.

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.540
How beautiful!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.500
And they sound much better 
than the preparations.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:56.180
You'd really never seen them before?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:18:00.950
I'd never even left my homeland.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:07.190
So when my comrades invited 
me today, I was so happy.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.900
Comrades?

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.010
I'm sorry you couldn't watch with them

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.700
because you were trying to help me.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.530
Not at all.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:24.350
Because of you, I was able to have a great view.

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:28.460
And more than anyone,

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.210
I know how wanting to see them feels.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.230
I shall reward you.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:48.480
A reward?

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:52.460
For bringing me this far.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.860
Give it no thought.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.990
It is a trifle.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.860
Thank you very much!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:08.730
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, will treasure it forever.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:14.470
Oh...

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.550
So you are Tsukishima?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:23.340
Let's finish this off with a bang!

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.000
Tenma...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.310
R-Right.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:27.310
Go!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:32.970
Here's the last one for today!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:07.440
Since when was there a hill over there?

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:09.490
What is that?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.100
Huh?

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:28.090
Well done, Matsunohara Kotori.

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:30.530
You honor me.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.200
Now, then.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:36.880
That insect's appearance heralds 
the arrival of summer.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.580
The insects are acting strangely.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.960
Something is different this year.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.370
It's a little early,

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:51.900
but I shall now seal myself away, 
according to the custom.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:56.650
<b>High-Ranking Minister - Insect Magistrate</b>

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:45.610
Let's go.

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:49.010
I'll follow that carriage wherever it goes.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.820
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:04.690
Once they see this hot body, 
any guy will do whatever I say!

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:07.700
The guy over there looks nice and stupid.

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:09.680
Come on, Samurai-sama, let's play.

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:11.030
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:12.670
Mitsuki's Honey Trap.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Mitsuki's Honey Trap</b>

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:14.000
What? You're ignoring me?!
